{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b5e8b40473902204c407e2c674cf54eefc0e399ce1007887d0199a6845c02411", "ja": "（美希とエレナのデュオ活動も、ようやく一段落。\n今日は溜まってる事務仕事でもするかな……）", "zh": "（美希和艾蕾娜的双人活动也终于告一段落。今天就来处理一下堆积的事务工作吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "71de25c45fb9ae65159140b7582f6f7d63ffd55acf4106c2b93c422796ead1f6", "ja": "ハニー、お疲れさまなの！\n……どうしたの？", "zh": "亲爱的，辛苦啦！\n……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6c1d04d85983976c9227c84875ba092cf67bc7b442e936919393ec0860778424", "ja": "うっ……美希、お疲れさま。", "zh": "唔……美希，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "c94c160a4b6bfe2ff6e97f7ddd4116555a7eb55bf858f4d2d65533f021db1ba6", "ja": "むー。せっかくミキが来てあげたのに、\nハニー、なんだかうれしくなさそう……。", "zh": "唔——美希好不容易才过来看你，\nHoney却好像不太高兴的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1004_p", "source_sha256": "87a1bf59c20cb2c3f1df37bdda1014c7d16d29c8cf9ef835cf26332bd5f5f1e3", "ja": "いや、ゴメン、そんな事はないけど。\n今から仕事しようとしたところだったから……。", "zh": "不，抱歉，我不是那个意思。\n只是我正准备开始工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "bd4859b6af51e7761f4192460a02dd9fca23058742507ca9e314097859847f78", "ja": "ミキ、邪魔しないよ？\nここでずっと、ハニーの顔見てるだけでいいもん。", "zh": "美希不打扰你哦？\n只要一直在这里看着亲爱的脸就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "5b336c628380451017458fd73327f5390a597443fcfd5e3cbfab9ed2c0b2f327", "ja": "おかまいなく。お仕事どーぞ。\nじーっ……。", "zh": "不用管我。你忙你的吧。\n盯——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1007_p", "source_sha256": "dbdca9d65ae825633674c49cf7dfbe6c5b0275867bb9171b8e4ad3d02f7d28d9", "ja": "いや、見られてると落ち着かないんだけど……。\n美希、何か用事があって来たんじゃないのか？", "zh": "不是，被这样盯着看，我实在静不下心来……  \n美希，你来这里不是有事要办吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "de18944af1511a52bd7a5a5b2fc829741c6ab4878711a1f94d6045037a13a166", "ja": "うん。あのね、\nエレナとのデュオ、大成功だったでしょ？", "zh": "嗯。我说啊，\n和艾莲娜的双人组合，大获成功了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7cc6e3d43d15f991cc07dc290f60c1690a77d8f70c31392cfdab2df6d2cba921", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n公演もPV撮影も、上手くいったし……。", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n无论是公演还是PV拍摄，都很顺利……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "faa6b6ab16395ad1f661ff5718cfb32d1ac54c1c836afe71e408ab92e12bf232", "ja": "ミキも、けっこう楽しかったよ。\nでも……。", "zh": "美希也觉得挺开心的。\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "e066c1ccfd584a0406acef9978eddc549b16e73259b8e9d815375a841f5f8678", "ja": "ミキはやっぱり、\nハニーにたくさん褒めてほしいなって☆", "zh": "我还是希望哈尼能多夸夸我呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1012_p", "source_sha256": "03776a7852cba8c12f649f140d3ca59eb833716fe9b4985f61814c5b6769d576", "ja": "なるほど。褒めるだけでいいのか？", "zh": "原来如此。只要夸奖就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "e01e55266bf9e0b9a9050622dac00370977496c0e9b47fc97b69e7a831ac4c44", "ja": "うん！　あ、でもどうせだったら、\nデートしたいな。ミキ、行きたいカフェがあるの♪", "zh": "嗯！啊，不过既然这样的话，我想去约会。美希有家想去的咖啡馆♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0c5a7dafbb54ae160195b6d1dca9a622813fd3c389c657223702471dd62f91ef", "ja": "そう来たか……。\nけど、まだ仕事が残ってるから……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……不过，还有工作没做完……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "ffe3fa1b6eaf4b2c3a5fa34b92935ebe48e6e1ebac5dba60776bdeb60a2e670b", "ja": "平気だよ、お仕事が終わるまで、待ってるから。\nおかまいなくなの！　じーっ……。", "zh": "没关系的，美希会等到你的工作做完。\n不用管我哦！盯——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "b71081a2b9beb457041bcf166e660a8b3e7c20aa845c6b1c04e9d6556269cd4e", "ja": "じーっ……じじじーっ。", "zh": "盯……继续盯——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0243_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7ccc73628df31e3c8b5565ae9d243b7555aeecca3290d3252cdd6992fb9fdc21", "ja": "（……うーん。ダメだなこれは。仕方ない！\n早めに切り上げて、カフェに行くとしよう！）", "zh": "（……嗯——不行啊，这个。没办法！早点收工，去咖啡馆吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
